# Phase 1 Triage Checklist — advanced-memory-mcp v2.0

**Created:** 2026-07-07 (Fable sprint, session 1)
**Spec:** `ARCHITECTURE_2_0.md` Phase 1 (rev 2026-07-07)
**Step 0 decision:** Option (a) — namespace surface wins. Portmanteaus retire in v2.0. Compact tool profile (`ADVANCED_MEMORY_TOOL_PROFILE=compact`, ≤20 tools) ships in the same release.
**Rules:** This file is the resumption point after any context reset. Work top to bottom. Mark items `[x]` with a date. Never delete a file before its logic's new home is listed in the "moved to" column and tests pass. All deletions require a git checkpoint commit first (GIT_REPOSITORY_SAFETY).

